from pathlib import Path
from docx import Document
ROOT=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]
def main():
 p=ROOT/'paper/MEGA27-23b-50p.docx';d=Document(p);title='Protected nonce prefix: a narrow proof and a prospective parity pilot'
 assert not any(x.text==title for x in d.paragraphs)
 d.add_heading(title,level=1)
 d.add_paragraph('A new frozen audit framing repeats the four-trit nonce three times as independently seeded four-base segments, and uses a fixed A seed for the following 48-base core. The decoder rejects unless all three decoded nonce copies agree. This removes the unprotected prefix association observed above at an emitted cost of twelve rather than four prefix bases per block: every block now occupies sixty nucleotides. Checks, ignored padding, outer parity and all three file copies remain charged. This is an audit-local candidate, not a production change.')
 d.add_heading('What the prefix proof covers',level=2)
 d.add_paragraph('At most two strict nucleotide substitutions confined to the twelve-base prefix can alter at most two independently seeded replicas. At least one four-base replica is untouched. If all decoded replicas agree, their value must equal that untouched original; otherwise decoding rejects. Exhaustive tests check all 81 nonce values, every single-position alternative and every two-position alternative: 51,030 events. This proves no accepted wrong nonce under that stated prefix-only channel. It does not correct the nonce, establish a whole-frame code distance, cover combined prefix/core edits, indels, shifted boundaries, a stochastic molecular channel or whole-file recovery. The core has a separate seed so prefix corruption does not redefine its boundary transition.')
 d.add_heading('Constraints and parity were fixed before noisy outcomes',level=2)
 d.add_paragraph('Two fresh 128-byte and two fresh 2048-byte identities receive both one and four interleaved parity stripes. First-passing nonce search is bounded to 81 candidates per block, jointly across all three detector sequences, with homopolymer length at most two, block60 GC [.35,.65], every sliding64 GC window [.35,.65] and whole-strand GC [.45,.55]. Failure excludes an identity/stripe geometry before noise. All eight tested geometries pass, with zero exclusions. Each identity receives two paired noise repetitions at zero and three percent and three copies, giving 96 trials, not 96 independent messages. Computational candidate attempts/rejections are retained separately from emitted nucleotide costs.')
 t=d.add_table(rows=1,cols=5);t.style='Light Shading Accent 1'
 for c,v in zip(t.rows[0].cells,['Payload','Stripes','Total nt/file','Clean per detector','3% exact: L/F/D']):c.text=v
 for row in [('128 bytes','1','4680','4/4','0/4;0/4;0/4'),('128 bytes','4','5220','4/4','1/4;2/4;2/4'),('2048 bytes','1','69480','4/4','0/4;0/4;0/4'),('2048 bytes','4','70020','4/4','0/4;0/4;0/4')]:
  for c,v in zip(t.add_row().cells,row):c.text=v
 d.add_paragraph('L/F/D denotes low, full and distance-five detectors. All clean trials recover exactly. Four stripes improve the tested small-file recovery for full and distance-five checks to two of four, but neither stripe allocation recovers a noisy long-file trial. Every remaining noisy outcome is loud; no silent wrong occurs in this small grid, which is not a never-wrong guarantee. More parity and prefix integrity do not automatically supply robust file recovery. New identities and geometry prevent a paired causal comparison with the old 52-base pilot, and the sixteen-of-sixteen earlier stripe outcome cannot be used as the baseline here.')
 d.add_paragraph('All outcomes, search ledgers, charged costs, source hashes and the prefix-only proof scope remain in results/protected_nonce_audit.json and experiments/protected_nonce_plan.json. Tests re-create clean sequences, local gates, parity accounting and the exhaustive prefix events. A stronger prefix can create more erasures under noise, while limited outer parity cannot repair many missing blocks. Optimized constrained coding, external codecs, primers, physical oligo geometry, indels, dropout and molecular-copy effects remain untested. This result advances framing integrity at an explicit cost while preserving the long-file recovery negative.')
 d.save(p)
if __name__=='__main__':main()
